-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §6: during §5's period the reform is applied
-- to schools by yearly lists the Ministry draws up, and to every new
-- teacher, from the school year תשס"ח.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `6`

DECLARE `section 6 action` IS ONE OF `draw up the list of schools for the year`

-- A school is under the reform from the year whose list names it; a new
-- teacher is, whatever the list says (§8).
@ref akn:art_6
GIVEN `on the list for the year` IS A BOOLEAN, `a new teacher` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the reform applies in the year` `on the list for the year` `a new teacher` IF
    `on the list for the year` OR `a new teacher`

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `section 6 action`
DECIDE `the yearly list of schools` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `draw up the list of schools for the year`
    LEST BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "section 6: the reform is applied to schools by yearly lists the Ministry draws up"

#ASSERT `the reform applies in the year` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the reform applies in the year` FALSE FALSE
